{"parse": {"title": "Barronite rocks", "pageid": 308851, "revid": 15208356, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Scenery\n|version1 = Full, left\n|version2 = Full, right\n|version3 = Empty, left\n|version4 = Empty, right\n|name1 = Barronite rocks\n|name2 = Barronite rocks\n|name3 = Rocks\n|name4 = Rocks\n|image1 = [[File:Barronite rocks (full, left).png|250x250px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Barronite rocks (full, right).png|250x250px]]\n|image3 = [[File:Barronite rocks (empty, left).png|250x250px]]\n|image4 = [[File:Barronite rocks (empty, right).png|250x250px]]\n|release = [[14 April]] [[2021]]\n|update = Below Ice Mountain\n|members = No\n|quest = No\n|location = [[Camdozaal Mines]]\n|options = Mine\n|examine = A rocky outcrop.\n|map = No\n|id1 = 41547\n|id2 = 41548\n|id3 = 41549\n|id4 = 41550\n}}\n'''Barronite rocks''' are found in the [[Ruins of Camdozaal]] that contain [[barronite shards]] and have a small chance of giving a [[barronite deposit]] when mined. The [[Varrock platebody]] does not give a chance of receiving double deposits.\n\n==Locations==\n{{ObjectTableHead}}\n{{ObjectLocLine\n|name = Barronite rocks\n|location = [[Camdozaal Mines]]\n|members = No\n|x:2905,y:5812|x:2910,y:5806|x:2910,y:5816|x:2914,y:5817|x:2918,y:5820|x:2924,y:5822|x:2928,y:5821|x:2937,y:5806|x:2941,y:5810|x:2905,y:5813|x:2910,y:5807|x:2911,y:5816|x:2915,y:5817|x:2919,y:5820|x:2925,y:5822|x:2929,y:5821|x:2936,y:5806|x:2941,y:5809\n|mtype = pin\n|mapID = -1\n|leagueRegion = asgarnia\n}}\n{{ObjectTableBottom}}\n\n==Mining info==\n{{Mining info\n|name = Barronite rocks\n|level = 14\n|skill1label = [[Barronite shards]] [[Mining|XP]]\n|skill1exp = 16\n|skill2label = [[Barronite deposit]] [[Mining|XP]]\n|skill2exp = 32\n|tool = [[Pickaxe]]\n|time = 1 minute\n|typename = Depletion time\n|type = 20 seconds\n}}\n\nRocks deplete 20 seconds after they start being being mined, and produce either [[barronite shards]] or a [[barronite deposit]] on every successful mining attempt. Receiving a deposit grants twice the experience of receiving shards.\n\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Barronite shards|quantity=4-6|rarity=76/100|skill=Mining|gemw=no}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Barronite deposit|quantity=1|rarity=24/100|skill=Mining|gemw=no}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\nThe probability to succeed on a given mining attempt scales with Mining level according to the figure below,{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1442837202262712322|date=28 August 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/96356|archivedate=10 October 2019|quote=Using the usual linear thing, I think it'd go from 31% at level 1 to 39% at level 99, though you may have unlocked a buff to help.|name=Barronite rock success chance tweet}} and can be permanently increased by 10% by activating the [[Charm of Mining]].\n\n{{Skilling success chart|label=Barronite rock mining chance|showbefore=no\n|label1=Barronite rock|low1=80|high1=100|req1=14|color1=mediumpurple|image1=Barronite deposit.png\n|label2=Charm of Mining|low2=105|high2=125|req2=14|color2=cadetblue|image2=Charm of Mining.png\n}}\n\n===Pre-roll===\n{{MiningPreGemDropTable}}\n\n===Tertiary===\nThe following items can drop together with the main resources. The rates shown are for a successful mining attempt.\n\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{SkillingTertiaryDropLines|skill=mining|baserate=741600|minlevel=14|maxlevel=99|varlamore=no|f2p=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Equipment==\n*{{plink|Celestial ring}}s and [[Celestial signet|signets]] provide an invisible +4 boost to Mining level, regardless of charges.\n*{{plink|Prospector kit|pic=Prospector helmet}} boosts Mining experience by 2.5%.\n*{{plink|Amulet of glory|pic=Amulet of glory(4)}} increases the chance of obtaining gems when charged.\n*[[Mining gloves (disambiguation)|Mining gloves]], [[Mining cape]]s, [[Varrock armour]], and charged celestial rings do not provide any chance to receive extra resources.\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 15 March 2023\n|update = The Last of Poll 78\n|poll= New Skill: Community Consultation and Poll 78\n|change = * The object has been renamed from \"Rocks\" to \"Barronite rocks\".\n* The \"Prospect\" option was removed.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 21 September 2022\n|update = Tombs of Amascut Changes & Beta Tweaks\n|change = An audio cue has been added to indicate the depletion of Barronite veins.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 16 April 2021\n|type = Hotfix\n|update = Below Ice Mountain\n|change =\n* Mining experience gained from obtaining a Barronite deposit increased from 24 to 32.\n* Mining experience gained from obtaining Barronite shards increased from 12 to 16.\n* The chance of successfully mining Barronite at high Mining levels has been decreased, but the chance at low Mining levels has been increased.\n* The extra chance of success afforded by the Charm of Mining has been increased from 5% to 10%.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 15 April 2021\n|type = Hotfix\n|update = Below Ice Mountain\n|change =\n* The base chance of getting a Barronite deposit increased from 3% to 24%.\n* Mining experience gained from obtaining a Barronite deposit reduced to 24 from 250.\n* Mining experience gained from obtaining Barronite shards reduced to 12 from 25.\n* The Charm of Mining now gives an extra 5% chance of success when mining, rather than 5% additional deposits.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Ruins of Camdozaal}}\n{{Mining}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:35.274880+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\"